        <mxCell id="sp_285" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.06;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.8px;color:#D56E0C;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kernel FORCE RLS &amp;amp; &amp;lt; 60s CMEK kill-switch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.06;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.4px;color:#3C4043;&quot;&gt;• Even if an application bug bypasses Hops 1–4, PostgreSQL kernel FORCE RLS reads 0 foreign disk pages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.06;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.4px;color:#3C4043;&quot;&gt;• Customer HSM key revocation halts Cloud Run, AlloyDB, and Memory Bank in 41.2s (&amp;lt; 60s SLA).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=18;fillColor=#FBF6E9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#D56E0C;fontSize=12.8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
